"short_description":"Ready for a peaceful day at Kitty Burger? Prepare warm burgers for your purring customers, complete their orders with care, and end the day surrounded by cheerful cat chatter. Kitty Burger is the cozy feline haven you\u2019ve been looking for to escape the stress of the day.","steam_appid":4119270,"support_info":{"email":"kittyburgerinfo@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Turkish, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}